    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.05",
    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your Charge phase right after a friendly **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit finishes a [Charge Move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move); that unit is the target.\n\n1. Pick an enemy unit it is engaged with.\n2. Pick one of its models that is engaged with that enemy.\n3. Roll D6s equal to that model's Toughness: each 1 inflicts 1 [Mortal Wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) on your unit, and each 5+ inflicts 1 on the enemy.\n\nNeither of the 2 units can take more than 6 mortal wounds this way.",
